description:
Category: IT Services

Location: Madrid Madrid Spain

For an International Institution we are urgently looking for a full remote Senior Automation tester with Python and Pytest experience.As a Senior Software Tester, you are responsible for the design and implementation of the set of automated tests covering ETL pipeline and for generation of a test dataset comparable in size with the annual load of production system and with similar probability distributions.

Candidates need to be fluent in English. This positions is long-term. Work permit is required. Candidates need to be based in Europe.

Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Troubleshoot and remediate data problems affecting availability and functionality;

• Assist and work with the Solution Architect and Senior Data Warehouse Specialist to develop, test and deliver the various Work Packages as further detailed below under “deliverables”;

• Ensure alignment with UN’s technical standards and procedures;

• Efficiently collaborate with other team members and stakeholders;

• Activity tracking with JIRA, CICD pipeline usage and alignment with Cloud unit practices;

• Perform other related duties as required;

Profile:

​

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• +5 years of experience in tests automation, especially database testing;

• Experience in Python and Pytest;

• Significant experience in test cases design and implementation, data modelling;

• Extensive proven experience in data warehouse development:

• SQL, CTE, window functions, facts/dimensions, ETL;

• Some experience with AWS IaC (CloudFormation) and CICD pipelines;

• Familiarity with CI/CD concept and integration testing tools in CI/CD pipelines;

• Understanding of the infrastructure-as-code concepts and experience with AWS CloudFormation;

• Fluent in English;

